</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Glen<br>
My method for friction free is the long piece of string.<br>
Anything that you hang from a hook in the ceiling has zero force opposing initial horizontal motion. The angle of deflection is a useful tool to measure any horizontal force.<br>
A platform suspended by 3 or 4 strings is an accurate measure of thrust, but demands construction of well balanced machinery.<br>
<br><br></td></tr>
